{"ch": 107, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "اَرَءَیۡتَ الَّذِیۡ یُکَذِّبُ بِالدِّیۡنِ ؕ﴿۲﴾", "en": "Hast thou seen him who rejects religion?", "w": ["hast thou seen", "him who", "rejects", "religion", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "فَذٰلِکَ الَّذِیۡ یَدُعُّ الۡیَتِیۡمَ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "That is the one who drives away the orphan,", "w": ["that is", "the one who", "drives away", "the orphan", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "وَلَا یَحُضُّ عَلٰی طَعَامِ الۡمِسۡکِیۡنِ ؕ﴿۴﴾", "en": "And urges not the feeding of the poor.", "w": ["and not", "urges", "of", "the feeding", "the poor", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "فَوَیۡلٌ لِّلۡمُصَلِّیۡنَ ۙ﴿۵﴾", "en": "So woe to those who pray,", "w": ["so woe", "to those who pray", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "الَّذِیۡنَ ہُمۡ عَنۡ صَلَاتِہِمۡ سَاہُوۡنَ ۙ﴿۶﴾", "en": "But are unmindful of their Prayer.", "w": ["those who", "they", "of", "their Prayer", "unmindful", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "الَّذِیۡنَ ہُمۡ یُرَآءُوۡنَ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "[✲]They like to be seen <i>of men</i>,", "w": ["those who", "they", "like to be seen <i>of men</i>", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "وَیَمۡنَعُوۡنَ الۡمَاعُوۡنَ ﴿٪۸﴾", "en": "[✲]And withhold <i>legal</i> alms.", "w": ["and withhold", "<i>legal</i> alms", ""]}]}